<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix D Complete Multilingual Safety Results ‣ Multilingual Safety Alignment Via Sparse Weight Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> provides the complete safety results for all eight languages in <span id="A4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Multi-StrongREJECT</span>, complementing the subset reported in Table <a href="#S5.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 5.2 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Multilingual Safety Alignment Via Sparse Weight Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> in the main text.
Consistent with our main findings, our training-free update reduces unsafe completions across most languages and backbones, and composes well with MPO (often yielding the lowest unsafe-response counts).</p>
</div>
